#: commands.docbook:662
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the <guilabel>Get Hot New Stuff</guilabel> dialog to download "
"additional data for &kstars;."
msgstr ""
"Otvori  <guilabel>Dobavi dobre stvari</guilabel> dijalog za preuzimanje "
"dodatnih podataka za  &kstars;."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:667
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Data</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Updates</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Podaci</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Ažuriranja</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:671
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This submenu can be used to update various object data, namely asteroid and "
"comet orbit elements as well as recent supernovae data from internet. The "
"data will be downloaded for the current user account only. If you use "
"&kstars; from different account you should download them for every account "
"separately."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj pod meni se moze koristiti za azuriranje raznovrsnih tipova podataka , "
"naime asteroide i komete  elemente koje kruze po orbiti  kao i nedavene "
"podatke o supernovama s interneta. Ti podaci mogu biti preuzeti jadino sa "
"trenutnog korisnickoga akaunta. Ako se koristis  &kstars; sa razlicitih "
"akaunta trebalo bi se preuzeti za svaki akaunt zasebno ."

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:673
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; tries to download recent supernovae list automatically by default. "
"You can switch the download off using <guilabel>Supernovae</guilabel> page "
"of &kstars; Settings window."
msgstr ""
"&kstars; pokusava da preuzme nedavnu listu supernovih koa zadano . Moze se "
"promijeniti preuzimanje  koristenjem <guilabel>Supernova</guilabel> stranicu "
"od  &kstars; Settings prozora ."

#. Tag: title
