#. Tag: menuchoice
#: commands.docbook:783
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Statusbar</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Show RA/Dec Field</guimenuitem>"
