#: commands.docbook:798
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This submenu contains all of the defined color schemes, including your "
"custom schemes. Select any item to set that color scheme."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj podmeni sadrzava sve definirane šeme boja, ukljucujuci standardne "
"šeme . Selektirajte bilo koji objekat da podesite semu boja ."

#. Tag: menuchoice
