msgstr "Modificiraj <link linkend=\"config\">konfiguraciske opcije </link>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:893
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kstars; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings "
"Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno &kstars;ima zajednicke  &kde; <guimenu>Postavke </guimenu> "
"i<guimenu>Pomoć </guimenu> meni stavke, za vise informacija pročitati "
"sekciju iznad <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Menia "
"za postavke </ulink> i<ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help"
"\">Menija za pomoc</ulink> od &kde; osnova."

#. Tag: title
