#, no-c-format
msgid "Help Menu"
msgstr "Meni pomoći"

#. Tag: sect2
#: commands.docbook:904
#, no-c-format
msgid "&help.menu.documentation;"
msgstr "&help.menu.documentation;"

#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:911
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Popup Menu</title>"
msgstr "<title>Popup Meni</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: commands.docbook:912
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Popup Menu</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Popup Meni</primary>"

#. Tag: secondary
#: commands.docbook:912
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:914
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <mousebutton>right</mousebutton> click popup menu is context-sensitive, "
"meaning its content varies depending on what kind of object you click on. We "
"list all possible popup menu items here, with the relevant object type [in "
"brackets]."
msgstr ""
"<mousebutton>Desni</mousebutton> klik popup meni zavisi od konteksta, tj. "
"njegov kontekst varira od toga na koji objekat je kliknuto. Ovdje "
"izlistavamo sve moguće popup menije sa relevantnim objektnim tipom. [in "
"brackets]."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:922 commands.docbook:931 commands.docbook:939
#: commands.docbook:947 commands.docbook:961 commands.docbook:969
#: commands.docbook:982 commands.docbook:993
#, no-c-format
msgid "[All]"
msgstr "[Sve]"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:923
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Identification and type: The top one to three lines are devoted to the name"
"(s) of the object, and its type. For stars, the Spectral Type is also shown "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Identifikacija i tipovi: One na vrhu jedna do tri linije su posvecene imenu "
"objekta, i njegovom tipu.Za zvijezde, spektralni tip se isto tako prikazuje "
"ovdje."

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:932
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rise, Transit, and Set times for the object on the current simulation date "
"are shown on the next three lines."
msgstr ""
"Rast, Prelazak, i postavi vrijeme za objekte na trenutnoj simulaciji datum "
"je pokazan u slijedeca tri reda  ."

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:940
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Center &amp; Track</guimenuitem>: Center the display on this "
"location, and engage tracking. Equivalent to double-clicking."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Centar &amp; Staza </guimenuitem>: Postavi displej na ovu "
"lokaciju , i pocni pratiti. Ekvivalent duplom kliku."

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:948
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Angular Distance To...</guimenuitem>: Enter \"angular distance "
"mode\". In this mode, a dotted line is drawn from the first target object to "
"the current mouse position. When you click with the &RMB; on a second "
"object, this will display the angular distance between the two objects near "
"the second object. You can press the &Esc; key to exit angular distance mode "
"without measuring an angle."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem> Ugaona udaljenost do ... </guimenuitem>: Unesite \"ugaone "
"udaljenosti mode\". U ovom režimu, a isprekidana linija se izvući iz prvog "
"ciljnog objekta na trenutni položaj miša. Kada kliknete &RMB; na drugom "
"objektu, to će prikazati ugaone udaljenosti između dva objekta u blizini "
"drugog objekta. Možete pritisnuti &Esc; taster za izlaz iz moda ugaone "
"udaljenosti bez mjerenja kuta."

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:962
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Details</guimenuitem>: Open the <link linkend=\"tool-details"
"\">Object Details window</link> for this object."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Detalji</guimenuitem>: Otvori <link linkend=\"tool-details"
"\">Prozor sa detaljima objekta </link> za ovaj objekat."

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:970
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Attach Label</guimenuitem>: Attach a permanent name label to "
"the object. If the object already has a label attached, this item will read "
"<guilabel>Remove Label</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Pričvrstiti labelu</guimenuitem>: Pricvrsti stalnu labelu s "
"imanom na objekat. Ako objekat vec ima lebelu s imenom pricvrscenu , ova "
"stavka ce procitati  <guilabel>Ukloni labelu</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:983
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Show ... Image</guimenuitem>: download an image of the object "
"from the internet, and display it in the Image Viewer tool. The \"...\" text "
"is replaced by a short description of the image's source. An object may have "
"multiple image links available in its popup menu."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Prikazuje... Sliku</guimenuitem>: preuzima sliku objekta s "
"interneta, i pokazuje je u Image Viwer alatu. \"...\" tekst je zamijenjen sa "
"kratkim opisom o izvoru slike. Neki objekat moze imati vise  linkova "
"prisutnih u popup meniu."

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:994
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>... Page</guimenuitem>: Display a webpage about the object in "
"your default web browser. The \"...\" text is replaced by a short "
"description of the page. An object may have multiple web links available in "
"its popup menu."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>... Stranica</guimenuitem>: Prikazuje web stranicu o objektu u "
"zadanom web pretraživaču. \"...\"tekst je zamijenjen sa kratkim opisom "
"stranice. Neki objekat može imati vise web linkova prisutnih u popup meniju."

