#. Tag: title
#: commands.docbook:1354
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mouse Commands"
msgstr "Komande miša"

#. Tag: secondary
#: commands.docbook:1356 commands.docbook:1358
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "Miš"

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1361
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving the mouse"
msgstr "Pomjerajuci mis"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1362
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The sky coordinates (RA/Dec and Az/Alt) of the mouse cursor are updated in "
"the status bar"
msgstr ""
"Nebeske koordinate (RA/Dec iAz/Alt) od kursora misa su azururane u statusnoj "
"traci"

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1368
#, no-c-format
msgid "\"Hovering\" the mouse"
msgstr "\"Lebdeci\" misem"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1369
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A temporary name label is attached to the object nearest to the mouse cursor."
msgstr ""
"Privremena labela sa imenom je pricvrscena na objekat najblize na kursor "
"misa."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1374
#, no-c-format
msgid "Left-clicking"
msgstr "Lijevi-klik"

#. Tag: secondary
#: commands.docbook:1378
#, no-c-format
msgid "Identifying"
msgstr "Identificiranje"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1378
#, no-c-format
msgid "The object nearest the mouse click is identified in the status bar."
msgstr "Najbliži objekat kliku misa će biti identificiran u statusnoj traci."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1384
#, no-c-format
msgid "Double-clicking"
msgstr "Dupli-klik"

#. Tag: secondary
#: commands.docbook:1388
#, no-c-format
msgid "Centering"
msgstr "Centriranje"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1388
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Center and track on the location or object nearest the mouse click. Double-"
"clicking on an Info Box will <quote>shade</quote> it to show/hide extra "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Postavi i prati na lokaciju ili objekat najblizi kliku misa.Duplim klikom na "
"Info Kutiju ce <quote>zasjeniti ga</quote> da pokaze/sakrije ekstra "
"informacije."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1395
#, no-c-format
msgid "Right-clicking"
msgstr "Desni klik"

#. Tag: secondary
#: commands.docbook:1399
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invoking Popup Menu for"
msgstr "Pokazivajuci Popup meni za"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1399
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the <link linkend=\"popup-menu\">popup menu</link> for the location or "
"object nearest the mouse cursor."
msgstr ""
"Otvori <link linkend=\"popup-menu\">popup menu</link> za lokaciju ili "
"objekat najbiliz ursoru misa."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1405
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrolling the mouse wheel"
msgstr "Skrolanjem misa"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1406
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Zoom the display in or out. If you do not have a mouse wheel, you can hold "
"the middle mouse button and drag vertically."
msgstr ""
"Povećaj ili smanji prikaz. Ako nema miš točkić, može se držati srednje dugme "
"na misu i vuci vertikalno."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1412
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click-and-dragging"
msgstr "Kinuti i vuci"

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1415
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dragging the sky map"
msgstr "Vuci nebeskumapu"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1416
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pan the display, following the drag motion."
msgstr "Pomaci ekran, prateci pokrete kretanja."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1419
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Ctrl;+dragging the sky map"
msgstr "&Ctrl;+vuci nebesku mapu"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1420
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Define a rectangle in the map. When the mouse button is released, the "
"display is zoomed in to match the field-of-view to the bounds of the "
"rectangle."
msgstr ""
"Definišite pravougaonik na mapi. Kada je dugme miša otpušteno ekran je "
"zumiran da odgovara polju pogleda granica pravougaonika."

#. Tag: term
#: commands.docbook:1425
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dragging an Info Box"
msgstr "Vuci Info kutiju"

#. Tag: para
#: commands.docbook:1426
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Info Box is repositioned in the map. Info Boxes will <quote>stick</"
"quote> to window edges, so that they remain on the edge when the window is "
"resized."
msgstr ""
"Info kutija je premjestena na mapi.Info kutije ce  <quote>primaci</quote> do "
"krajeva prozora, tako da one ostanu na krajevima prozora kada je prozor "
"rasiren."
